  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "Congratulations! your level is up! as you level up, you can",
      "receive 5 points at character's stats. your character will be",
      "grown up by being divided stats evenly among power, spirit,",
      "talent, agility, and health. now click C. you can divide stats",
      "in the window of character info.",
      "power = ATK, STM, recovery of STM, HP, absorb,",
      "            and weight incresed ",
      "spirit = magic ATK, MP, and recovery of MP incresed",
      "talent = ATK RTG, ATK power, defense, STM, speed,",
      "           and absorb increased ",
      "agility = damage of shooting weapon, ATK RTG,",
      "           and defense increased ",
      "health = HP, recovery of HP, STM, weight,",
      "           and recovery of MP incresed",
      "",
